OL,3,GNEWSACould 200 asylum seekers be housed
OL,4,Ain Fenland?
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of protesters marched through a
OL,7,Fquiet Fenland village carrying placards
OL,8,Fsaying "No asylum seekers here please"
OL,9,Fand "Battle for Britain 2026".
OL,11,FFenland District Council said it had
OL,12,Fbeen told by the Home Office a site in
OL,13,FLeverington, Cambridgeshire, could
OL,14,F"provide 26 bed spaces for mothers and
OL,15,Fbabies".
OL,17,FAccording to Steve Barclay, the
OL,18,FConservative MP for North East
OL,19,FCambridgeshire, Fenland could
OL,20,Feventually see 205 asylum seekers
OL,21,Fliving across the district.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
